From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 23:17:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: gut cloud_api_client to no-op stub

Replace the websocket/REST client to zed.dev with a stub that returns
CloudDisabled / NotSignedIn for every method. Drop yawc, gpui_tokio,
serde_json, and the websocket module so no network code remains in
the crate. Preserve CloudApiClient + ClientApiError + LlmApiToken
types so the kept call sites in the client crate continue to
compile. This stub is intentionally retained as a type-only no-op
handle and is never fully stripped (the later sign-in removal does
not touch it).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
